OL,3,GNEWSAKimmins orders officials to 'get
OL,4,Aon with job' of A5 upgrade after court
OL,5,Aruling
OL,6,
OL,7,FInfrastructure Minister Liz Kimmins has
OL,8,Fordered officials to "get on with the
OL,9,Fjob" of building one of Northern
OL,10,FIreland's biggest road projects after a
OL,11,Fcourt ruling blocking the work was
OL,12,Foverturned.
OL,14,FAt the Court of Appeal in Belfast, Lady
OL,15,FChief Justice Dame Siobhan Keegan said
OL,16,Fa ruling by a judge in 2025 preventing
OL,17,Fthe upgrade of the A5 was "problematic"
OL,18,Fand could not stand.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
