OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAKimmins orders officials to 'get
OL,4,Aon with job' of A5 upgrade after court
OL,5,Aruling
OL,6,
OL,7,FProposals to build a new dual
OL,8,Fcarriageway between Londonderry and
OL,9,FAughnacloy in County Tyrone go back
OL,10,Falmost 20 years but have been beset by
OL,11,Ffunding and legal issues.
OL,13,FConcerns had also been raised about the
OL,14,Fenvironmental impact of building a new
OL,15,Froad and how much farmland it would
OL,16,Faffect.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
